{"seq":1,"slug":"direct-mail-vs-bonded-warehouse-routing","title":"直邮小包 vs 海外仓/保税备货：门槛失效后的路径成本翻转决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/parcel-routing-fulfillment/direct-mail-vs-bonded-warehouse-routing","wordCount":2807,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"直邮小包-vs-海外仓-保税备货-门槛失效后的路径成本翻转决策\">直邮小包 vs 海外仓/保税备货：门槛失效后的路径成本翻转决策</h1><p>一笔从深圳发往洛杉矶的 30 美元订单，在 2025 年 8 月 29 日之前和之后，最优履约路径可能完全相反。门槛存续时，直邮小包（direct mail，逐个包裹经邮政或快递渠道直发）几乎是无脑选择：单件可变成本低、无库存、次周即可上线新品。当低值免税覆盖消失，每个包裹都要面对按价计征的关税与逐票的报关处理费，直邮的单件成本曲线整体上移，而海外仓/保税备货（overseas warehouse / bonded inventory，整批入境、本地存货、本地发货）的固定成本则被摊薄到同样的销量之上。<strong>路径选择从「默认直邮」变成了一个必须逐 SKU 计算的成本翻转问题。</strong></p>\n<p>本文不讨论某国门槛的绝对值，也不预测下一个取消窗口；它讨论工程与运营问题——门槛这个「隐性补贴」被撤掉后，决策系统靠什么成本模型、盈亏平衡公式和风险约束，判断一个 SKU 该走直邮还是备货。门槛规则本身的分类与版本化见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../policy-rule-model/de-minimis-threshold-taxonomy\">低值免税门槛分类与法域构成要素</a> 与 <a href=\"../policy-rule-model/effective-dated-policy-rule-engine\">生效期感知的政策规则引擎</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-门槛是对直邮路径的隐性补贴\">核心概念：门槛是对直邮路径的隐性补贴</h2><p>把 de minimis 理解成「免税额度」会掩盖它的真实经济角色。在门槛存续的法域里，它同时豁免三样成本：<strong>关税</strong>（按完税价格计征）、<strong>进口环节增值税的简易征收</strong>（如欧盟 IOSS 下的简化申报）、以及<strong>逐票正式报关的固定处理费</strong>（brokerage / entry fee，含报关行费、MPF 等按票计提项）。这三样有一个共同特征——它们都是<strong>按包裹（per-parcel）发生</strong>的，而直邮模式的成本天然按包裹展开，所以门槛几乎把直邮最大的一块可变成本直接抹零。</p>\n<p>门槛一旦取消，被抹掉的三项原样回到每个包裹上：一件 <code>V</code> 美元的商品，关税是 <code>d·V</code>，而报关处理费是与货值无关的常数 <code>C_entry</code>。这解释了为什么门槛失效对不同价位的冲击并不均匀——<code>C_entry</code> 对小额订单的相对占比远高于大额订单，所以<strong>低单价 SKU 的成本翻转最剧烈</strong>，而低单价恰恰是直邮小包的主力品类。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[订单/SKU] --&gt; B{目的法域门槛是否存续?}&#10;    B --&gt;|存续| C[直邮小包&lt;br/&gt;豁免关税+简易申报+免逐票报关费]&#10;    B --&gt;|失效| D[直邮小包&lt;br/&gt;关税 d·V + 逐票报关费 C_entry]&#10;    B --&gt;|失效| E[海外仓/保税备货&lt;br/&gt;整批入境承担关税, 本地发货省末程]&#10;    C --&gt; F[单件可变成本低&lt;br/&gt;无库存风险]&#10;    D --&gt; G{单件总成本 vs 备货摊薄成本}&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt;|直邮更低| H[继续直邮]&#10;    G --&gt;|备货更低| I[转入备货]&#10;    G --&gt;|差距在风险带内| J[混合路径]\">graph TD\n    A[订单/SKU] --&gt; B{目的法域门槛是否存续?}\n    B --&gt;|存续| C[直邮小包&lt;br/&gt;豁免关税+简易申报+免逐票报关费]\n    B --&gt;|失效| D[直邮小包&lt;br/&gt;关税 d·V + 逐票报关费 C_entry]\n    B --&gt;|失效| E[海外仓/保税备货&lt;br/&gt;整批入境承担关税, 本地发货省末程]\n    C --&gt; F[单件可变成本低&lt;br/&gt;无库存风险]\n    D --&gt; G{单件总成本 vs 备货摊薄成本}\n    E --&gt; G\n    G --&gt;|直邮更低| H[继续直邮]\n    G --&gt;|备货更低| I[转入备货]\n    G --&gt;|差距在风险带内| J[混合路径]</pre><p>两条路径的成本结构差异可以概括为一张对照表——它们是<strong>两种不同的成本形态</strong>，不能只比较单位数字：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直邮小包</th>\n<th>海外仓/保税备货</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本性质</td>\n<td>以可变成本为主（按票发生）</td>\n<td>以固定+半固定成本为主（按批发生）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛失效的冲击</td>\n<td>关税 + 逐票报关费直接落到每单</td>\n<td>关税整批入境时一次性承担，摊到单件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国际干线</td>\n<td>邮政/商业小包（小批量、高单价/公斤）</td>\n<td>整柜/整批海运或包机（大批量、低单价/公斤）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末程配送</td>\n<td>跨境末端派送，时效 5–15 天</td>\n<td>本地派送，时效 1–3 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存风险</td>\n<td>无，可即时上下架新品</td>\n<td>有，滞销=资金占用+仓储费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金占用</td>\n<td>低（卖出才采购）</td>\n<td>高（提前备货、提前纳税）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规复杂度</td>\n<td>单票申报、逐票清关</td>\n<td>整批进口报关 + 本地税务登记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键工程结论：<strong>门槛失效并不自动意味着应该转海外仓</strong>。它只是取消了直邮的一项成本优势；是否翻转，取决于销量能否把备货的固定成本摊到低于直邮上浮后的单件成本。这需要显式的盈亏平衡计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条路径的单件成本分解\">两条路径的单件成本分解</h2><p>先把两条路径各自的单件成本写成可计算式。直邮路径的单件成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mtext>lastmile</mtext><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>entry</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>returns</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{direct}} = C_{\\text{post}} + C_{\\text{lastmile}}^{x} + d \\cdot V + C_{\\text{entry}} + f_{\\text{returns}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lastmile</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">entry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">returns</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>C_post</code> 是跨境小包运费（按重量/体积计），<code>C_lastmile^x</code> 是跨境末端派送，<code>d·V</code> 是关税，<code>C_entry</code> 是逐票报关处理费，<code>f_returns</code> 是退货处置分摊。门槛存续时 <code>d=0</code> 且 <code>C_entry≈0</code>，这就是直邮曾经的绝对优势来源。</p>\n<p>海外仓/保税备货的单件成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>wh</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>bulk</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>inbound</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>declared</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>干线+关税摊薄</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>storage</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fulfil</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mtext>lastmile</mtext><mtext>local</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{wh}} = \\underbrace{\\frac{C_{\\text{bulk}} + C_{\\text{inbound}} + d \\cdot V_{\\text{declared}} \\cdot Q_{\\text{batch}}}{Q}}_{\\text{干线+关税摊薄}} + C_{\\text{storage}} \\cdot T + C_{\\text{fulfil}} + C_{\\text{lastmile}}^{\\text{local}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6365em;vertical-align:-2.2651em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.1647em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">干线</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">关税摊薄</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.843em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bulk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inbound</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">declared</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5284em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.2651em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">storage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fulfil</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lastmile</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>逐项差异值得拆开看：<strong>干线成本被摊薄</strong>（整批入境的 <code>C_bulk</code> 除以批量 <code>Q</code> 后，单件干线成本通常显著低于小包）；<strong>关税在批次层承担</strong>（备货关税按 <code>V_declared · Q_batch</code> 一次性缴纳，摊到单件是 <code>d·V_declared</code>，形式上与直邮同量级，但备货<strong>没有 <code>C_entry</code></strong>——一批货一次报关，逐票报关费被摊到接近零）；<strong>新增仓储与履约费</strong>（<code>C_storage · T</code> 按天累积，<code>T</code> 是库存周转天数；<code>C_fulfil</code> 是拣货打包，这两项直邮没有）；<strong>末程本地派送</strong>取代跨境末端，单件通常更低且时效更好。</p>\n<p>这项拆解给出一个反直觉但重要的判断：<strong>备货路径赢在 <code>C_entry</code>（逐票报关费）与干线摊薄，而不是赢在关税本身</strong>。关税两条路径都要承担；真正被备货消掉的，是直邮「每一单都要重新报关一次」的固定处理成本。所以在 <code>C_entry</code> 极高、关税税率 <code>d</code> 反而温和的法域，翻转来得最早。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盈亏平衡-翻转点的公式化判定\">盈亏平衡：翻转点的公式化判定</h2><p>决策的核心是求「备货路径单件成本 ≤ 直邮路径单件成本」的销量门槛。设备货路径的一次性固定投入为 <code>F</code>（含整批采购资金、一次性入境成本中不随销量变化的部分、系统与证件成本），备货的随销量变动单件成本为 <code>v_wh</code>，直邮单件成本为 <code>c_direct</code>。则总成本相等的临界销量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>wh</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>当且仅当 </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>wh</mtext></msub><mtext> 时存在正解</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^{*} = \\frac{F}{c_{\\text{direct}} - v_{\\text{wh}}}, \\qquad \\text{当且仅当 } c_{\\text{direct}} &gt; v_{\\text{wh}} \\text{ 时存在正解}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当且仅当</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时存在正解</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式给出三条可操作的判断：<strong>分母必须为正</strong>（若 <code>c_direct ≤ v_wh</code>，例如加征关税后直邮反而更便宜、或备货的仓储+履约费过高，备货永远不划算，与销量无关）；<strong><code>Q*</code> 就是决策线</strong>（预测销量高于 <code>Q*</code> 则备货更省，低于则直邮更省；门槛失效把 <code>c_direct</code> 抬高，从而改变分母）；<strong><code>F</code> 越大 <code>Q*</code> 越高</strong>（高单价、需资质如本地 VAT 登记、需冷链的品类 <code>F</code> 大，翻转点被推得很高，往往不值得为小销量备货）。</p>\n<p>代入一个示意：设某 SKU 直邮单件成本由 12 美元（门槛存续）升到 18 美元（门槛失效，<code>d·V+C_entry</code> 贡献 6 美元），备货后单件可变成本 11 美元，一次性固定投入 <code>F=7000</code> 美元。则 <code>Q* = 7000/(18-11) = 1000</code> 件。该 SKU 若季度预测 300 件，直邮仍优；若爆款预测 5000 件，则备货显著更省。<strong>门槛失效把同一 SKU 的 <code>Q*</code> 从「永不需要备货」变成「存在有限翻转点」——这才是「路径成本翻转」的精确含义。</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意 <code>F</code> 与 <code>v_wh</code> 都需要按法域、品类、时效要求实测，不能套用别国经验值。门槛与计值口径的差异会直接改变 <code>d·V</code> 中的 <code>V</code>——内在价值口径 vs CIF 口径的差别见 <a href=\"../declaration-duty-engine/declared-value-consignment-modeling\">申报价值与 consignment 建模</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"库存与需求风险-被成本模型漏掉的那一半\">库存与需求风险：被成本模型漏掉的那一半</h2><p>只算盈亏平衡会系统性高估备货的吸引力，因为 <code>C_wh</code> 里没有显式写进<strong>库存风险的成本</strong>。备货的固定投入 <code>F</code> 一旦花出，就转化为一批在途或入库的实物；需求预测偏乐观时，滞销库存的成本是双重的——资金占用（机会成本）与持续累积的仓储费（<code>C_storage · T</code> 中 <code>T</code> 被拉长）。用一个风险调整项把它纳入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mtext>wh</mtext><mtext>risk</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>wh</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>dead</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cost</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dispose</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{wh}}^{\\text{risk}} = C_{\\text{wh}} + p_{\\text{dead}} \\cdot (V_{\\text{cost}} + C_{\\text{dispose}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wh</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cost</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispose</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>p_dead</code> 是滞销概率，<code>V_cost</code> 是滞销库存采购成本，<code>C_dispose</code> 是清仓/销毁成本。需求越不确定、生命周期越短的品类，<code>p_dead</code> 越高，备货真实成本被低估得越严重。这解释了为什么<strong>长尾 SKU 在门槛失效后往往仍留直邮</strong>：预测销量本就低于 <code>Q*</code>，且 <code>p_dead</code> 高，两条证据都指向直邮；真正转向备货的是<strong>需求集中、复购稳定、生命周期长</strong>的头部 SKU。工程结论是：决策系统应输出<strong>按 SKU 的翻转点 <code>Q*</code> 与预测销量分布的比较</strong>并显式扣掉风险项，而非「该不该备货」的布尔值，以免在需求高波动区误判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合路径-不翻转的第三选项\">混合路径：不翻转的第三选项</h2><p>当 <code>Q*</code> 处在预测销量的置信区间之内（说不清翻不翻转）时，最优解往往不是二选一，而是<strong>混合路径</strong>：头部 SKU 走备货保时效与成本，长尾 SKU 走直邮保留弹性，用一个本地小仓做「虚拟库存」的缓冲。常见形态有：<strong>爆款前置备货 + 长尾直邮</strong>（按 SKU 分级，用上节的 <code>Q*</code> 与销量分布把 SKU 分成「必须备」「必须邮」「待定」三桶，待定桶用时效切分）；<strong>保税仓 + 海外仓双层</strong>（以中国跨境电商出口为例，海关监管方式「1210」保税跨境电商允许货物先进保税仓、按实际订单出区报关，适合监管确定性高、退货率可控的品类，「9610」直邮/集货出口对应直邮路径，「9710/9810」B2B 直接出口与海外仓出口对应整批到海外仓——三者都靠摊薄 <code>C_entry</code> 获益，但承担了库存与关税前置）；<strong>动态再平衡</strong>（门槛规则可变，见 <a href=\"../policy-rule-model/effective-dated-policy-rule-engine\">生效期感知的政策规则引擎</a>，规则引擎应在门槛生效/失效事件触发时重跑 <code>Q*</code> 并输出需迁移的 SKU 清单）。</p>\n<p>混合路径的代价是<strong>运营复杂度</strong>：两套库存视图、两套清关流程、跨路径的库存调拨。它的适用边界是「头部 SKU 的确定性足以支撑备货、长尾的不确定性足以否定备货」——SKU 结构两极分化时系统复杂度被业务价值抵消，结构均匀时则只是徒增复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>门槛是直邮路径的隐性补贴</strong>：它同时抹掉关税、简易征税与逐票报关费三项按包裹发生的成本，失效即取消补贴。</li>\n<li><strong>翻转的主因是逐票报关费 <code>C_entry</code>，而非关税本身</strong>——关税两条路径都要承担，备货消掉的是「每单重新报关一次」的固定成本与干线摊薄。</li>\n<li><strong>判定靠盈亏平衡点 <code>Q* = F/(c_direct - v_wh)</code></strong>：分母为负则永不备货；销量分布超过 <code>Q*</code> 才转备货。</li>\n<li><strong>必须扣除库存风险项</strong>：<code>p_dead</code> 高的长尾 SKU 即使跨过 <code>Q*</code> 也可能不值得备货；决策输出应是「翻转点 vs 销量分布」的比较。</li>\n<li><strong>混合路径在翻转点不确定时最优</strong>：爆款备货 + 长尾直邮、保税仓 + 海外仓双层，用监管方式（1210/9610/9710）对应不同路径。</li>\n<li><strong>路径选择是动态的</strong>：门槛规则带生效期，规则变更事件应触发 <code>Q*</code> 重算与 SKU 迁移清单，而非一次性配置。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"直邮小包 vs 海外仓/保税备货：门槛失效后的路径成本翻转决策","id":"直邮小包-vs-海外仓-保税备货-门槛失效后的路径成本翻转决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：门槛是对直邮路径的隐性补贴","id":"核心概念-门槛是对直邮路径的隐性补贴"},{"level":2,"text":"两条路径的单件成本分解","id":"两条路径的单件成本分解"},{"level":2,"text":"盈亏平衡：翻转点的公式化判定","id":"盈亏平衡-翻转点的公式化判定"},{"level":2,"text":"库存与需求风险：被成本模型漏掉的那一半","id":"库存与需求风险-被成本模型漏掉的那一半"},{"level":2,"text":"混合路径：不翻转的第三选项","id":"混合路径-不翻转的第三选项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"IOSS / 进口增值税征收与一站式申报的系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/declaration-duty-engine/ioss-vat-collection-integration"},"next":{"title":"承运商与邮政渠道选择：清关模式、DDP/DDU 与关税垫付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/parcel-routing-fulfillment/carrier-postal-channel-selection"}}